ֿשְּׁ ׳נִשְׁאֲרוּ Neh 1:2 , cf . 1:3 , מִןהַֿשְּׁ ׳הַשָּׁבִים 8:17 , הַגּוֺלָה מִשְּׁבִי הָעֹלִים Ezra 2:1 = Neh 7:6 , מֵהַשְּׁ ׳הַבָּאִים Ezra 3:8 ; 8:35 . 2 act of capture , שׁ ׳עִם סוּסֵיכֶם Amos 4:10 ; שִׁבְיָהּ שִׁמְלַת Deut 21:13 i. e. garb in which she was captured (&gt; others captivity , in both: Amos 4:10 = your captive horses ; Deut 21:13 he captive's garb ). 3 = captives (coll): Exod 12:29 (J), Num 31:12 , 19 , 26 (man and beast), Isa 20:4 (|| גָּלוּת 49:24-25 , Hab 1:9 + Ezek 32:9 ᵐ5 and others (see שֶׁבֶר near the end ); apparently feminine singular Isa 52:2 (but see שָׁבִי ); object of שָׁבָה (q. v.) Judg 5:12 (&gt; ᵑ6 שֹׁבֶיךָ JDMich We Bu Now), Num 21:1 (JE), Deut 21:10 ; Psa 68:19 ; 2Chr 28:17 . שָׁבִי adjective or noun masculine whence] שְׁבִיָּה noun feminine captive (compare Rahlfs עני u. ענר in Psalm 63 ); — ׳שׁ בַּתצִֿיּוֺן Isa 52:2 b (Bev JPhII. xcii (1888) p.127 ingeniously , ׳וגו הַבַּת, שְׁבִי compare || שְׁבִי , v a and, on {abbrev } הַבּ , Lam 2:13 ; read also ׳שׁ יְרוּשָׁלָ֑םִ v a (for שְׁבִי ) Oort Bu Du Che HParticiple Marti.","rootNote":"from 7618 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Chr 28 17","keyReferences":["2Chr 28 17","2Chr 29 9","Amos 4 10","Amos 9 4","Dan 11 8","Dan 11 33","Deut 21 10","Deut 28 41"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":48,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Chr 28 17","book":"2Chr","chapter":28,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שֶֽׁבִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 29 9","book":"2Chr","chapter":29,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/שְּׁבִ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"Amos 4 10","book":"Amos","chapter":4,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׁבִ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcbsc"},{"reference":"Amos 9 4","book":"Amos","chapter":9,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַ/שְּׁבִי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncbsa"},{"reference":"Dan 11 8",